## [Unreleased] - 2026-03-20T00:00:00

### Fixed

**`desktop_app/ui.html`**

- **Invisible alternating table rows** - Bulma's `.table` stylesheet was applying a light background to `td` elements, making white text invisible on odd rows. Fixed by adding an explicit `background: var(--bg-box)` and `color: var(--text)` to `#results table td`, ensuring all rows are legible against the dark theme.

- **Horizontal scroll not working** - Three compounding issues prevented horizontal scrolling in the results table. (1) `#results-container` and `#results-scroll-wrap` both had `overflow-x: auto`, causing the inner container to absorb the overflow and hide the scrollbar from the outer wrapper - fixed by removing `overflow-x` from `#results-container`. (2) The table used `width: 100%`, preventing it from ever exceeding container width - fixed by switching to `width: max-content; min-width: 100%`. (3) `.column` (a Bulma flex item) defaulted to `min-width: auto`, allowing it to grow unbounded to fit the table rather than constraining it - fixed by adding `min-width: 0`, which bounds the column to the flex container and lets `#results-scroll-wrap` properly detect and scroll overflowing content.

